   471	
   472	    Never raises; all problems are collected into the returned result's
   473	    ``errors`` list. ``accepted`` is True only when the proposal is self-
   474	    consistent by its own declarations -- this is never evidence that the
   475	    described native/bootstrap closure is real, complete or reachable.
